1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">♣ 2012학년도 1학기 재입학자, 한국장학재단 학자금융자를 받는 학생,&nbsp;</span></span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">한국장학재단 장학금을 받는 학생(수업료보다 장학금액이 많은 경우),<br>&nbsp;&nbsp; ’우등’이상 장학금(교내)을 받는 학생은&nbsp;</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">분할납부를 신청할 수 없습니다.</span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">♣ 분할납부를 신청한 학생은 신용카드로 등록금을 납부할 수 없습니다.</span></span></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font size=\"3\"><font color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">♣ 1차분을 납부기간에 납부하지 않을시 분할납부 신청이 취소됩니다.</span></span><br></font></font></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;</span></p></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><p>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">1. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#003300\">분할납부 신청기간 : 02.01.(수)~02.14.(화) 18시</font></strong></span></font></u></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u></u></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">2. </span></span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#003300\">분할납부 신청방법 : 우편신청, 방문신청</font></strong></span></font></u></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; ■</span></span></font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"> 본인도장, 보호자도장을 반드시 찍어 주시기 바랍니다.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (본인 및 보호자도장이 없는 경우에는 분할납부를 신청할수 없습니다.)</span><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">우편신청시 주소 : 구미시 대학로 61 금오공대 경리팀(본관 504호)</span><br><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (우편번호 : 730-701)</span><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> 방문신청시 : 경리팀(본관 504호)으로 오시기 바랍니다. </font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u></u></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">3. </span></span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#003300\">분할납부 고지서발급</font></strong></span></font></u></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#808080\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; ■</span></span></font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> Kit포탈-</font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">원스톱서비스-학사-등록에서 발급</span><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> 2월 15일부터 발급 예정</font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u></u></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">4. </span></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#003300\">분할납부 납부기간 및 납부장소</font></strong></span></font></u></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><font color=\"#808080\"><font color=\"#333333\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp; ■</span></span></font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">1차 : 02.21.(화)~02.24.(금) [농협, 대구은행, 우체국, 신한은행]</span><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2차 : 03.22.(목)~03.23.(금) [농협]</span><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> </font><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">3차 : 04.19.(목)~04.20.(금) [농협]</span><br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> 4차 : 05.17.(목)~05.21.(월) [농협]</font></font></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u></u></font>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8\"><font color=\"#000000\" size=\"3\"><u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕; FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\">5. </font></span></span></u><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><strong style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\"><font color=\"#003300\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">분할 납부금액 및 양식</span></span><br></font></u></font></strong></span><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\">&nbsp;’분할납부 신청서’ 양식을 참조하시기 바랍니다.<br></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#808080\"><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\" color=\"#000000\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\">6. </span></font></u></span><strong><font color=\"#003300\"><u><font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #faecc5\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang, 바탕\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">분할납부 신청서 양식</span></span><br></font></u></font></strong>&nbsp; ■</font></font><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\" color=\"#000000\"> 소속 신청서 양식으로 작성하여 주시기 바랍니다.<br><font style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" color=\"#333333\">&nbsp; ■</font